#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:161
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Flavia"
msgstr "Flavia"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:167
msgid ""
"Popular among traders and smugglers, the Flavia is a small cargo and "
"passenger transport. It's cheaper than a freighter for small loads and short "
"distances, and is often used to carry high-value cargo discreetly."
msgstr "Popular among traders and smugglers, the Flavia is a small cargo and passenger transport. It's cheaper than a freighter for small loads and short distances, and is often used to carry high-value cargo discreetly."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:178
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Flavia Falcon"
msgstr "Flavia Falcon"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:182
msgid ""
"The Flavia Falcon is a variant of the Flavia small transport modified for "
"faster flight, and adds rear-mounted beam weapons to keep enemies off its "
"back."
msgstr "The Flavia Falcon is a variant of the Flavia small transport modified for faster flight, and adds rear-mounted beam weapons to keep enemies off its back."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:192
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Flavia P.Falcon"
msgstr "Flavia P.Falcon"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:197
msgid ""
"The Flavia P.Falcon is a variant of the Flavia Falcon, and adds a nuclear-"
"capable rear-facing weapon tube and warp drive to its improved impulse "
"engine and rear-facing beam weapons."
msgstr "The Flavia P.Falcon is a variant of the Flavia Falcon, and adds a nuclear-capable rear-facing weapon tube and warp drive to its improved impulse engine and rear-facing beam weapons."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:239
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Repulse"
msgstr "Repulse"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:246
msgid ""
"The Repulse is an armed and armored transport ship based on the popular "
"Flavia design. Despite its bolstered shields and hull, it remains faster "
"than a stock Flavia, or even the Flavia Falcon, but is slightly slower than "
"the Flavia P.Falcon variant."
msgstr "The Repulse is an armed and armoured transport ship based on the popular Flavia design. Despite its bolstered shields and hull, it remains faster than a stock Flavia, or even the Flavia Falcon, but is slightly slower than the Flavia P.Falcon variant."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:291
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Apis"
msgstr "Apis"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:292
#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:308
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Tug"
msgstr "Tug"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:297
msgid ""
"The unarmed Apis tugboat, named for the genus of honeybees, is a reliable "
"but small transport. Due to its low cost, it's commonly used to train "
"fledgling captains and crews without risking friendly fire."
msgstr "The unarmed Apis tugboat, named for the genus of honeybees, is a reliable but small transport. Due to its low cost, it's commonly used to train fledgling captains and crews without risking friendly fire."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:307
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Hylas"
msgstr "Hylas"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:311
msgid ""
"The Hylas is an unarmed tugboat with a powerful short-range tractor beam "
"capable of moving much larger ships through gravity-field manipulation. It's "
"nimble on its own and lightly shielded to avoid taking damage from "
"collisions with larger ships, but it's otherwise defenseless."
msgstr "The Hylas is an unarmed tugboat with a powerful short-range tractor beam capable of moving much larger ships through gravity-field manipulation. It's nimble on its own and lightly shielded to avoid taking damage from collisions with larger ships, but it's otherwise defenseless."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:319
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Heracles"
msgstr "Heracles"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/auxiliaries.lua:323
msgid ""
"The Heracles tug model is a Hylas suited for carrier use in deep-space "
"operations. Improvements include a stronger hull, bolstered shield, full "
"sensor suite, and a shield-disrupting beam for use in boarding-operation "
"support, abandoned vessel salvage, and investigations of unknown ships."
msgstr "The Heracles tug model is a Hylas suited for carrier use in deep-space operations. Improvements include a stronger hull, bolstered shield, full sensor suite, and a shield-disrupting beam for use in boarding-operation support, abandoned vessel salvage, and investigations of unknown ships."
